WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.950
Speaker 1: One of the things I've talked about
with you guys over the years is not unique

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:10.320
to the United States, but it's particularly
bad in the United States, which is when you

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:15.889
have the degree of connections between media
figures who are ostensibly journalists or

00:00:15.889 --> 00:00:21.290
reporters are supposed to be people that are
sort of critically analyzing and talking to

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:26.699
you about what government is doing when you
have those media people so closely tied in

00:00:26.699 --> 00:00:31.230
with, friendly with, involved with whatever
the very people in government that they're

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:32.810
supposed to be covering.

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:39.180
You don't really get journalism by definition
or in any real sense of the word.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:45.120
And one of the things that we've seen over
time over the last year since the January

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:51.710
six Trump riots is the degree to which right
wing media like Fox News and others are so

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:52.710
connected.

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:55.100
We're so connected to the Trump administration.

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:59.430
We've learned about these text messages that
were exchanged between Sean Hannity and Mark

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:03.550
Meadows and others in the aftermath of the
Trump riots about how best to manage it and

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:04.930
how this is a bad thing.

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:07.510
And Trump's got to stop talking about the
stolen election.

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:11.150
But then he would go on the air and he would
support the Trump narrative and do something

00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:13.840
totally different and part of what goes on.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.070
And I've talked about this before because
I've been in some of these circles before

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:25.080
on the periphery is people don't want to lose
access, and that influences a lot of how media

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:26.080
behaves.

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:30.800
They become an acquaintance of someone in
power.

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:32.980
They start to get access to them.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:37.740
And next thing you're, you know, you're Maria
Bartiromo, who has a direct line to Trump

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:41.760
and nods along to any insane notion that he
mentions.

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:44.530
So that's one piece of it that we don't want
to lose access part.

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:49.380
The other part of it is how they're actually,
in some cases, is almost no daylight between

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:51.490
the media and the government piece.

00:01:51.490 --> 00:01:56.230
And there's now an explosive new report with
another little chapter in that.

00:01:56.230 --> 00:02:03.130
Sean Hannity, Fox News propagandist, sent
Trump's former White House press secretary

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:10.429
Kayleigh McEnany a post riot playbook, according
to newly released texts.

00:02:10.429 --> 00:02:17.530
Fox News's Sean Hannity reports HuffPost sent
Kayleigh McEnany a plan to handle Trump the

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:23.250
day after the deadly Capitol riot, according
to new, newly released text messages.

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:29.420
Hannity message McEnany on January 7th with
a quote five point approach for conversations

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:31.270
with Trump.

00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:36.300
Hannity was telling McEnany how to manage
Trump, according to a letter that the White

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:40.090
House that the House committee investigating
the riots released on Thursday.

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:45.610
The first two items on Hannity's plan of action
read No more stolen election talk.

00:02:45.610 --> 00:02:47.500
Again, this is this is a trend.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:52.150
Hannity recognized that the stolen election
talk was not helping Trump to.

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:57.480
Yes, impeachment and 25th Amendment are real,
and many people will quit.

00:02:57.480 --> 00:03:03.560
So it seems like Hannity is telling McEnany
say to Trump, you could be impeached.

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:05.390
The 25th Amendment could be used.

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:07.920
Your allies will quit if that happens.

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:09.290
Sort of like to warn Trump.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:14.250
And the letter didn't reveal points three,
four and five, and McEnany responded in those

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:15.250
text messages.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:16.720
Love that.

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:17.730
Thank you.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:22.900
That is the playbook I will help reinforce,
Hannity told McEnany.

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:30.290
It was quote key that quote no more crazy
people were allowed to access the then president.

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:35.330
McEnany responded, Yes, 100 percent.

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:42.989
McEnany Days In the days after the election,
remember that McEnany appeared with those

00:03:42.989 --> 00:03:44.950
crazy people, Sidney said.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:48.870
I'm trying to think I believe there was one
particular press conference, and I don't know

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:50.690
if it's the one where Rudy's face melted.

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:51.800
I don't know.

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:53.030
It's all kind of a blur.

00:03:53.030 --> 00:03:59.800
But McEnany appeared remember in her role
as a Trump campaign staffer, not as the press

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:07.510
secretary, alongside some combination of Sidney
Powell, Jenna Ellis and or Rudy Giuliani.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:13.120
And yet McEnany knew and agreed that these
are crazy people around the president.

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:17.900
So there's three, four or five different important
layers here.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:24.159
One is this cozy relationship between Fox
and the Trump administration wasn't serving

00:04:24.159 --> 00:04:25.159
anybody.

00:04:25.159 --> 00:04:29.189
You had people at Fox and people around Trump
who knew how insane this all was.

00:04:29.189 --> 00:04:34.999
I mean, listen, quite frankly, we now have
text messages that show us Kaley and Hannity

00:04:34.999 --> 00:04:40.050
both thought there were crazy people around
Trump giving him bad ideas.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:44.499
The stolen election talk was a bad idea, and
yet they both went out and reinforced it,

00:04:44.499 --> 00:04:46.930
showing that this was not them behaving on
principle.

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:51.090
This was them behaving on, call it, self-preservation
for McEnany.

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:55.029
Call it ratings for Hannity, maintaining access
to Trump, whatever.

00:04:55.029 --> 00:04:57.599
So that's one aspect of this.

00:04:57.599 --> 00:04:58.599
And then of.

00:04:58.599 --> 00:05:05.529
Number two, that nobody is better off when
you have this, journalism is not better off,

00:05:05.529 --> 00:05:08.330
the American people are not more informed.

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:12.319
The people running government are not running
government in a way that is better for the

00:05:12.319 --> 00:05:14.039
people.

00:05:14.039 --> 00:05:17.939
Everybody loses in these situations and I
know that there will be there will be people

00:05:17.939 --> 00:05:22.600
who say, Well, you know, Chris Cuomo seemed
to be pretty friendly with Hillary Clinton

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:23.600
back in 2016.

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:25.210
They clearly know each other.

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:27.050
Yes, they clearly have.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:30.349
The Clintons and the Cuomo clearly seem to
know each other.

00:05:30.349 --> 00:05:38.169
But there was not this operationally indistinguishable
relationship that was going on when it came

00:05:38.169 --> 00:05:39.169
to governance.

00:05:39.169 --> 00:05:40.169
And it just doesn't.

00:05:40.169 --> 00:05:45.499
It seems like such a lame comparison when
you now see the connections between Fox and

00:05:45.499 --> 00:05:46.659
the Trump administration.

00:05:46.659 --> 00:05:49.050
So here's just, you know, the text messages.

00:05:49.050 --> 00:06:56.740
Just another example.

